-  osd_renderer:
-    file: rtl/osd_renderer.v
-    domain: clk_pix
-    desc: >
-      行缓冲式 OSD 渲染。在显示第 N 行时把第 N+1 行渲染进乒乓行缓冲。
-      支持 16 个文字域，每域可独立设置位置、字号倍率、颜色、闪烁。
-      输出与像素流严格对齐的 osd_rgb / osd_alpha。
-    ports:
-      - {name: clk,          dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: rst_n,        dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: x,            dir: in,  width: 10}
-      - {name: y,            dir: in,  width: 10}
-      - {name: de,           dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: line_start,   dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: frame_start,  dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: frame_cnt,    dir: in,  width: 16, desc: "用于闪烁相位"}
-      - {name: qstate,       dir: in,  width: 128}
-      - {name: param,        dir: in,  width: 64}
-      - {name: cfg_we,       dir: in,  width: 1,  desc: "clk_pix 域写口（上游已做 CDC）"}
-      - {name: cfg_addr,     dir: in,  width: 10}
-      - {name: cfg_wdata,    dir: in,  width: 32}
-      - {name: font_addr,    dir: out, width: 14}
-      - {name: font_dout,    dir: in,  width: 32}
-      - {name: osd_rgb,      dir: out, width: 24}
-      - {name: osd_alpha,    dir: out, width: 8, desc: "0=完全透明 255=完全不透明"}
-
-  osd_compositor:
-    file: rtl/osd_compositor.v
-    domain: clk_pix
-    desc: >
-      最终合成级。顺序：底图 -> 亮度/对比度调节 -> OSD 文字层 alpha 混合 ->
-      频谱层 alpha 混合 -> 输出。亮度为加性偏置（param.brightness-128），
-      对比度为乘性增益（Q4.4，param.contrast 128 对应 1.0），运算后饱和截断到 0..255。
-    ports:
-      - {name: clk,         dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: rst_n,       dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: de_in,       dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: hs_in,       dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: vs_in,       dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: rgb_base,    dir: in,  width: 24}
-      - {name: osd_rgb,     dir: in,  width: 24}
-      - {name: osd_alpha,   dir: in,  width: 8}
-      - {name: spec_rgb,    dir: in,  width: 24}
-      - {name: spec_alpha,  dir: in,  width: 8}
-      - {name: param,       dir: in,  width: 64}
-      - {name: de_out,      dir: out, width: 1}
-      - {name: hs_out,      dir: out, width: 1}
-      - {name: vs_out,      dir: out, width: 1}
-      - {name: rgb_out,     dir: out, width: 24}
-
-  bilinear_scaler:
-    file: rtl/bilinear_scaler.v
-    domain: clk_sys
-    desc: >
-      双线性缩放，作用在载入路径（不是显示路径）：把任意 src_w x src_h 的解码像素流
-      缩放到 640x480 后再写 SDRAM。用两行行缓冲，定点步进 Q16.16。
-      这样显示侧永远是 640x480，带宽和时序都不受源图尺寸影响。
-    ports:
-      - {name: clk,       dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: rst_n,     dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: bypass,    dir: in,  width: 1,  desc: "源图恰为 640x480 时直通"}
-      - {name: src_w,     dir: in,  width: 11}
-      - {name: src_h,     dir: in,  width: 11}
-      - {name: in_valid,  dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: in_ready,  dir: out, width: 1, desc: "仅在本拍可接收像素时拉高"}
-      - {name: in_rgb,    dir: in,  width: 24}
-      - {name: in_x,      dir: in,  width: 11}
-      - {name: in_y,      dir: in,  width: 11}
-      - {name: in_last,   dir: in,  width: 1}
-      - {name: out_ready, dir: in, width: 1, desc: "输出反压，停顿时保持坐标和颜色"}
-      - {name: out_valid, dir: out, width: 1}
-      - {name: out_rgb,   dir: out, width: 24}
-      - {name: out_x,     dir: out, width: 10}
-      - {name: out_y,     dir: out, width: 10}
-      - {name: out_last,  dir: out, width: 1}
