+ns: medq
+title: "MedQ HDMI 门诊叫号终端 - 接口契约（冻结）"
+device: EG4S20BG256
+board: HX4S20C
+hdl: verilog-2001
+status: frozen_with_simulation_closure_amendments_2026_10_26
+
+td_hardware_amendments:
+  date: "2026-10-26"
+  preserved: "公开端口、顶层管脚、时钟频率与 SIMULATION 分支"
+  serializer: "非 SIMULATION 使用 EG_LOGIC_ODDR；25/125 MHz 相关时钟；LSB-first，每周期输出一对；保留 STA 关系"
+  validation: "sim/run_vendor_serdes.py，仅串化器原语功能模型；PLL/SDRAM/板卡尚未验收"
+  constraints: "40 bit 顶层 IO 从同型 DEMO 映射；SDC 为草案"
+  generated_pll: "真实顶层使用 medq_pll (TD 6.2.168116 生成)：50 -> 125/25/100 MHz，共同 extlock；SIMULATION 保留旧时钟模型"
+  fat32_ram: "扇区四 byte-lane 同步 BRAM，目录预取 8 word；字节流可有一拍预取间隙，valid/ready 语义与内容不变"
+
+resource_optimization_amendments:
+  date: "2026-10-26"
+  preserved: "公开端口、ROM与业务位域、OSD延迟；20张UI画面逐字节一致"
+  pixel_math: "有界精确/255与窄位宽；AA、混色、BC不近似"
+  fat32: "power-of-two cluster shift；挂载FAT大小用8拍shift/add，mount_done延后8拍"
+  spectrum_history: "保存旧投影坐标，保持既有输出；显示正确性另行验收"
+  goertzel: "单个注册32x32运算，TD=4DSP；signed32状态，修正复位/块清空/系数/功率；规范见behavior_spec.md"
+  goertzel_budget: "2*BINS递推+8*BINS功率，默认160拍；忙时额外stb忽略"
